{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1500","id":4018882886,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vi0lG","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1500","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1500.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1500.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1500","number":1500,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1-MS-REVEAL-RUNTIME-HVY-01] Freeze launch runtime readiness gates","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1487.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR freezes the post-attempt 9709 MS source reveal runtime-readiness boundary beyond the #1452/#1465 contract-only shell. It adds a deterministic builder, validator, readback, and the required checked-in readiness artifacts for `post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-readiness-boundary`.\n\nThe boundary records the current #1465 baseline counts, including 3530 governed rows, 47 page-level reveal candidate rows, 60 unique page assets, 0 generated screenshots, 0 Codex visual QA passes, and 0 production side effects. It explicitly states that contract-only success is not launch readiness and that 3530 question availability is independent of MS reveal availability.\n\n## Runtime Gates\n\nThe readiness artifact defines numeric thresholds for row coverage, locator coverage, screenshot generation, Codex visual QA, row-to-page visual QA alignment, controlled delivery, server-side reveal receipts, no-preload behavior, side-effect zeroing, feature-flag posture, post-attempt route/UI rehearsal, image performance, mobile readability, self-assessment evidence strength, and scoped final closeout verdicts.\n\nIt also treats the parent #1486 P0/P1 amendments as binding gates: deterministic PDF text-layer extraction is allowed for locator backfill, OCR/VLM/external model calls remain forbidden, locator schema must support multi-page/page-range views, screenshot binaries are not committed by default, release scope is explicit, runtime authorization must use server-side signed/recorded receipts, public production is feature-flagged off by default, self-assessment stays low-strength, rehearsal is local-first, and final closeout must split scoped alpha, full 9709 beta, and public launch verdicts.\n\n## Product and Legal Boundary\n\nThe artifact preserves the product/legal split: `product_display_policy_posture` remains a product decision with `release_scope`, `legal_authorization_status` remains a separate disclosure/status field, and product-allowed-with-takedown is not represented as licensed or officially authorized.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-readiness-boundary.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-readiness-boundary.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-readiness-boundary.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-readiness-boundary.mjs`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (top_status `warning` only for branch naming / ahead-of-upstream during local PR prep; artifact guards healthy)\n\nNo production Supabase writes, production RAG/vector mutations, or external model calls were performed.\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T02:36:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T02:43:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T02:43:46Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T02:43:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"ddc453891bde8f1bf38155806c44c4de2a4fa34c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1500/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1500/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1500/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/805d2649648ceb2aa7227c399e0aa7e03f30d966","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1487","ref":"feat/issue-1487","sha":"805d2649648ceb2aa7227c399e0aa7e03f30d966","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","re